Cell["\<\
The empty diagram has no subdiagrams and identity port mappings (its input \
and output port lists are empty).\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a0e37ca6-b9b7-4c4a-8666-f7768c44bfe0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"DiagramProduct", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["d", "TI"], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"EmptyDiagram", "[", "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3d019126-b6a8-4478-9480-e6e48a39e0df"],
 " and similarly for any other position."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a8852590-6df0-4e81-a7a9-e4ab217f2d39"]
